|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| w/o GRU | 56.46% | 31.98% | 17.40% | 99.829 | 66.73 |
| w/o Kalman | 56.98% | 32.19% | 17.71% | 99.689 | 66.80 |
| w/o MeanShift | 58.12% | 37.92% | 17.60% | 98.447 | 66.96 |
